Coldwell will lead us to victory!


@GHW

= The Williams Faction

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; text-align: left; ">
    <div>
    George Williams is a former president of the UFC(SS) and on the left-wing of the party. Williams led the UFC(SS) into provincial politics on a socialist programme and was the architect behind the controversial "use-lease" policy, a program that would: 

    A: Disallow the sale of crown lands in favour of a use-lease

    B: Provide an option for land-owning farmers to enter the use-lease program

    Williams has faced controversy over his visit to the Soviet Union, returning with approval for its largely state-managed agricultural sector (nonetheless, he seeks a different path for Saskatchewan agriculture). It is guaranteed that this history will be pounced upon by the Liberals and almost certainly prove too contentious for any Conservative-CCF electoral alliance, even with the relatively open James Anderson leading. 
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div id="GHW" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 2px ridge tan;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/WilliamsHaraGeorge.jpg"><span class="card-caption">George Williams</span></div>
        <div id="Phelps"  style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/PhelpsJoe.jpg"><span class="card-caption">Joe Phelps</span></div>
        <div id="Brockelbank"  style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/BrockelbankJohn.jpg"><span class="card-caption">John Brockelbank</span></div>
    </div>
</div>

@MJC

= The Coldwell Faction
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; text-align: left; ">
    <div>
    Major James Coldwell is the moderate former leader of the ILP and former PPS member. He has political and governing experience, having served as a Regina City Councillor in the past, and has been active in the teacher's unions. 
    
    As a middle-class professional, it is likely that he will be able to expand the party's appeal into the cities. While he is on the right-wing of the party, he remains avowedly against an electoral pact with the Conservatives. 
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div id="MJC" class="face-figure" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 2px ridge tan;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/ColdwellMajorJames.jpg"><span class="card-caption">Major James Coldwell</span></div>
        <div id="Douglas" class="face-figure" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/DouglasTommy.jpg"><span class="card-caption">Tommy Douglas</span></div>
        <div id="Fines" class="face-figure" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/FinesClarence.jpg"><span class="card-caption">Clarence Fines</span></div>
    </div>
</div>